{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXILED AND ABANDONED</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banished from your homeland, you awaken the dormant powers of necromancy within you. On a secluded forest clearing, you raise your shrine and repel wave after wave of heroic attackers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the fight to your foes by engaging them head-on, or let your towers and skeletal legion do the heavy lifting. The battlefield is yours to command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514820/extras/5886ba11314967c045cee6b66552b002.poster.avif?t=1773017415\" width=794 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514820/extras/5886ba11314967c045cee6b66552b002.webm?t=1773017415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514820/extras/5886ba11314967c045cee6b66552b002.mp4?t=1773017415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR BASE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct towers, fences, barracks, and a vast array of structures. Every placement is in your hands\u2014strategize and design the ultimate defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514820/extras/eb7387de8e51d2432fa2b77c14458a70.poster.avif?t=1773017415\" width=794 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514820/extras/eb7387de8e51d2432fa2b77c14458a70.webm?t=1773017415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514820/extras/eb7387de8e51d2432fa2b77c14458a70.mp4?t=1773017415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GATHER RESOURCES</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather vital resources and grow your base. With each expansion, you strengthen your hold against increasingly formidable enemy waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514820/extras/eae7197f8020e97c82885a3fb3f2531c.poster.avif?t=1773017415\" width=794 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514820/extras/eae7197f8020e97c82885a3fb3f2531c.webm?t=1773017415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514820/extras/eae7197f8020e97c82885a3fb3f2531c.mp4?t=1773017415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMPROVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn experience with every encounter, unlock powerful perks, and refine your strategy to make each run better than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514820/extras/407ef5f554234cb3788efa7ec5cf8ab0.poster.avif?t=1773017415\" width=794 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514820/extras/407ef5f554234cb3788efa7ec5cf8ab0.webm?t=1773017415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514820/extras/407ef5f554234cb3788efa7ec5cf8ab0.mp4?t=1773017415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bumper Harvest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3514820/566a856a2a9de4f37c1a619892314ff6bfaea0e4.jpg"},{"name":"R